# Design System

Applies to UI and frontend work. For visual decisions, consult `docs/DESIGN_SPEC.md`.

## Direction

Dark, minimal, editorial, calm. Personal corner of the internet—not a gaming site or AI portfolio template.

**Theme:** dark · **Accent:** green · **Type:** Geist · **Layout:** spacious / editorial · **Motion:** subtle

## Palette (accents, not backgrounds)

| Token | Value |
|---|---|
| Sage (primary accent) | `#9CB080` |
| Muted green | `#618764` |
| Deep green | `#2B5748` |
| Green charcoal | `#273338` |
| Background | `#0D1110` |
| Surface | `#141A17` |
| Elevated | `#1B2420` |
| Text primary / secondary / muted | `#F1F3EF` / `#A8AEA8` / `#737A74` |

Use CSS design tokens. Do not introduce unapproved colors.

## Typography

Geist only for now. Personality from **scale, spacing, and composition**—not decorative fonts.

## Do / Don't

**Do:** whitespace, strong hierarchy, restrained green accents, editorial/asymmetric layouts, semantic HTML, mobile + desktop together.

**Don't:** neon cyberpunk, excessive gradients, glassmorphism, particle/glow spectacle, turning everything into cards, unnecessary animation, generic AI portfolio aesthetics, filling empty space for its own sake.

## Motion, responsive, a11y

- Motion: hover, light entrances, nav/page transitions only; respect `prefers-reduced-motion`
- Responsive: intentional mobile reading flow, not a collapsed desktop
- Accessibility: keyboard nav, visible focus, contrast, alt text, heading hierarchy, touch targets; no hover-only interaction
